algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm ComputeMeasurementInvariant(Ob, F, r, P):
    total ← 0
    for each Y ∈ Ob:
        signatures ← {}
        for each x ∈ F(Y):
            sig ← (r(Y, Z)(x) for Z ∈ P)
            signatures.add(sig)
        total ← total + |signatures|
    return total

Complexity: O(Σ_Y |F(Y)| · |P|) time, O(max_Y |F(Y)|) space.
